  '2026-05-17-2026-05-17-telegram-telegram-user-45-codex-desktop-cli-поддерживает-режим-копать-отсюда-до-об-signal#3', '2026-05-17-2026-05-17-telegram-telegram-user-45-codex-desktop-cli-поддерживает-режим-копать-отсюда-до-об-signal', 3, 'Technical details',
  '## Technical details

- Local Codex CLI help shows a `features` command and supports `--enable <FEATURE>`, equivalent to `-c features.<name>=true`.
- Current local config does not include this flag.', '471cc71d858407776f518d13226fe7a9b4c719e8581eaaa4cbccee35d63231c2', 40
);
INSERT INTO chunks_fts (text, heading, document_id, chunk_id)
VALUES ('## Technical details

- Local Codex CLI help shows a `features` command and supports `--enable <FEATURE>`, equivalent to `-c features.<name>=true`.
- Current local config does not include this flag.', 'Technical details', '2026-05-17-2026-05-17-telegram-telegram-user-45-codex-desktop-cli-поддерживает-режим-копать-отсюда-до-об-signal', '2026-05-17-2026-05-17-telegram-telegram-user-45-codex-desktop-cli-поддерживает-режим-копать-отсюда-до-об-signal#3');

INSERT INTO chunks (id, document_id, ordinal, heading, text, hash, token_count)
VALUES (
  '2026-05-17-2026-05-17-telegram-telegram-user-45-codex-desktop-cli-поддерживает-режим-копать-отсюда-до-об-signal#4', '2026-05-17-2026-05-17-telegram-telegram-user-45-codex-desktop-cli-поддерживает-режим-копать-отсюда-до-об-signal', 4, 'Agent design implications',
  '## Agent design implications

- Long-horizon modes need stronger completion contracts, budgets, stop conditions and reporting requirements.
- Useful for eval generation, adversarial task design, repo exploration and "dig until blocked" research.
- Risk: unattended autonomy can waste tokens/time or make broad edits; it needs sandboxing, explicit write scope and final diff/report checks.', '32b21c7e927d2f77270793d1f3f78b83aed3665d9cb05eb7e53e34cbcec8ec01', 72
);
INSERT INTO chunks_fts (text, heading, document_id, chunk_id)
VALUES ('## Agent design implications

- Long-horizon modes need stronger completion contracts, budgets, stop conditions and reporting requirements.
- Useful for eval generation, adversarial task design, repo exploration and "dig until blocked" research.
- Risk: unattended autonomy can waste tokens/time or make broad edits; it needs sandboxing, explicit write scope and final diff/report checks.', 'Agent design implications', '2026-05-17-2026-05-17-telegram-telegram-user-45-codex-desktop-cli-поддерживает-режим-копать-отсюда-до-об-signal', '2026-05-17-2026-05-17-telegram-telegram-user-45-codex-desktop-cli-поддерживает-режим-копать-отсюда-до-об-signal#4');

INSERT INTO chunks (id, document_id, ordinal, heading, text, hash, token_count)
VALUES (
  '2026-05-17-2026-05-17-telegram-telegram-user-45-codex-desktop-cli-поддерживает-режим-копать-отсюда-до-об-signal#5', '2026-05-17-2026-05-17-telegram-telegram-user-45-codex-desktop-cli-поддерживает-режим-копать-отсюда-до-об-signal', 5, 'Candidate rules',
  '## Candidate rules

- Do not enable long-horizon goal mode globally until verified.
- Long-running agent tasks must have a budget, write scope, stop condition and final summary contract.
- For adversarial benchmark generation, require a fairness check: the task may be harder for agents, but must remain solvable and honest.', 'da166a92fd34ca9b7f4f9f0e53daed4e1fc38770a7222f8d40e497d93859edc4', 69
);
INSERT INTO chunks_fts (text, heading, document_id, chunk_id)
VALUES ('## Candidate rules

- Do not enable long-horizon goal mode globally until verified.
- Long-running agent tasks must have a budget, write scope, stop condition and final summary contract.
- For adversarial benchmark generation, require a fairness check: the task may be harder for agents, but must remain solvable and honest.', 'Candidate rules', '2026-05-17-2026-05-17-telegram-telegram-user-45-codex-desktop-cli-поддерживает-режим-копать-отсюда-до-об-signal', '2026-05-17-2026-05-17-telegram-telegram-user-45-codex-desktop-cli-поддерживает-режим-копать-отсюда-до-об-signal#5');

