- Add AI-critical-thinking exercises when an agent teaches or trains a user to rely on AI tools.
- Treat education/future-of-work videos as supporting context unless they provide concrete methods, evals or primary evidence.', 'Candidate rules', '2026-06-01-media-transcript-auzan-ai-education-human-potential-signal', '2026-06-01-media-transcript-auzan-ai-education-human-potential-signal#5');

