Retention: source-purged', 'Signal: Agent Scheduling And Heartbeat Source Batch', '2026-06-02-agent-scheduling-heartbeat-source-batch-signal', '2026-06-02-agent-scheduling-heartbeat-source-batch-signal#1');

INSERT INTO chunks (id, document_id, ordinal, heading, text, hash, token_count)
VALUES (
  '2026-06-02-agent-scheduling-heartbeat-source-batch-signal#2', '2026-06-02-agent-scheduling-heartbeat-source-batch-signal', 2, 'Core Signal',
  '## Core Signal

Cron and heartbeat are not interchangeable implementation details. They define
how much autonomy an agent has while the user is absent. For Pritha, scheduled
behavior must be contract-selected, observable, bounded, memory-safe and easy
to disable.

The useful taxonomy is:

- user-level scheduled prompt: product feature such as ChatGPT Tasks;
- cron/scheduled job: bounded task at a known time;
- interval/heartbeat: repeated wake/check loop;
- event-driven watcher: reacts to webhook/queue/source changes;
- durable workflow schedule: orchestration with persisted history, retries,
  signals and audit.', '67a0fdda57941629e6454dc7013eac0613c89c40636c0f383f621cb593581e4d', 115
);
INSERT INTO chunks_fts (text, heading, document_id, chunk_id)
VALUES ('## Core Signal

Cron and heartbeat are not interchangeable implementation details. They define
how much autonomy an agent has while the user is absent. For Pritha, scheduled
behavior must be contract-selected, observable, bounded, memory-safe and easy
to disable.

The useful taxonomy is:

- user-level scheduled prompt: product feature such as ChatGPT Tasks;
- cron/scheduled job: bounded task at a known time;
- interval/heartbeat: repeated wake/check loop;
- event-driven watcher: reacts to webhook/queue/source changes;
- durable workflow schedule: orchestration with persisted history, retries,
  signals and audit.', 'Core Signal', '2026-06-02-agent-scheduling-heartbeat-source-batch-signal', '2026-06-02-agent-scheduling-heartbeat-source-batch-signal#2');

INSERT INTO chunks (id, document_id, ordinal, heading, text, hash, token_count)
VALUES (
  '2026-06-02-agent-scheduling-heartbeat-source-batch-signal#3', '2026-06-02-agent-scheduling-heartbeat-source-batch-signal', 3, 'Useful Delta For Pritha',
  '## Useful Delta For Pritha

- Default remains `proactive_mode: none | manual`. No cron, heartbeat,
  launchd, queue watcher or background pulse without explicit contract choice.
- Prefer scheduled isolated jobs for reports, reminders and maintenance.
- Use heartbeat only for cheap deterministic checks and event detection.
  Heartbeat must not directly write long-term memory from untrusted sources.
- If a background loop reads email, Slack, RSS, web pages, GitHub or other
  external content, route it through quarantine, scanner, processed signal and
  approval/verification before memory mutation.
- For long-running multi-step work, prefer durable workflow orchestration over
  ad hoc sleep loops or cron chains.
- Every scheduled agent job needs observability: last run, next run, status,
  duration, missed-run policy, retries, alert channel and kill switch.', 'aa8c12c0f2eb39554c7ac09974866ac3100a37c7e3ffdc69bb8d5314b73da58e', 165
);
INSERT INTO chunks_fts (text, heading, document_id, chunk_id)
VALUES ('## Useful Delta For Pritha

- Default remains `proactive_mode: none | manual`. No cron, heartbeat,
  launchd, queue watcher or background pulse without explicit contract choice.
- Prefer scheduled isolated jobs for reports, reminders and maintenance.
- Use heartbeat only for cheap deterministic checks and event detection.
  Heartbeat must not directly write long-term memory from untrusted sources.
- If a background loop reads email, Slack, RSS, web pages, GitHub or other
  external content, route it through quarantine, scanner, processed signal and
  approval/verification before memory mutation.
- For long-running multi-step work, prefer durable workflow orchestration over
  ad hoc sleep loops or cron chains.
- Every scheduled agent job needs observability: last run, next run, status,
  duration, missed-run policy, retries, alert channel and kill switch.', 'Useful Delta For Pritha', '2026-06-02-agent-scheduling-heartbeat-source-batch-signal', '2026-06-02-agent-scheduling-heartbeat-source-batch-signal#3');

INSERT INTO chunks (id, document_id, ordinal, heading, text, hash, token_count)
VALUES (
  '2026-06-02-agent-scheduling-heartbeat-source-batch-signal#4', '2026-06-02-agent-scheduling-heartbeat-source-batch-signal', 4, 'Deduplication Note',
  '## Deduplication Note

This source batch does not replace existing Hermes/OpenClaw cron notes. It
promotes a general Pritha standard: child agents must decide proactivity mode,
scheduler owner, concurrency, memory write policy and monitoring before any
scheduled behavior is scaffolded.', '7f41ab6bc3bb8cbeda831d3e51a8db2073f63469c7806096dcbcad56d5df355a', 53
);
INSERT INTO chunks_fts (text, heading, document_id, chunk_id)
VALUES ('## Deduplication Note

This source batch does not replace existing Hermes/OpenClaw cron notes. It
promotes a general Pritha standard: child agents must decide proactivity mode,
scheduler owner, concurrency, memory write policy and monitoring before any
scheduled behavior is scaffolded.', 'Deduplication Note', '2026-06-02-agent-scheduling-heartbeat-source-batch-signal', '2026-06-02-agent-scheduling-heartbeat-source-batch-signal#4');

INSERT INTO chunks (id, document_id, ordinal, heading, text, hash, token_count)
VALUES (
  '2026-06-02-agent-scheduling-heartbeat-source-batch-signal#5', '2026-06-02-agent-scheduling-heartbeat-source-batch-signal', 5, 'Caution',
  '## Caution

The arXiv heartbeat paper makes the memory-safety risk concrete: background
execution can silently ingest untrusted content into the same memory/context
used for foreground conversations. For Pritha descendants, this means:

- no shared foreground/background memory channel by default;
- no direct memory writes from heartbeat material;
- no hidden background source ingestion;
- no autonomous notification loop without user-visible run records.', 'b06a99b770a51b8ae477d19c1329ac140de6a6534dfb78b035f5f6f2f78093ad', 84
);
INSERT INTO chunks_fts (text, heading, document_id, chunk_id)
VALUES ('## Caution

The arXiv heartbeat paper makes the memory-safety risk concrete: background
execution can silently ingest untrusted content into the same memory/context
used for foreground conversations. For Pritha descendants, this means:

- no shared foreground/background memory channel by default;
- no direct memory writes from heartbeat material;
- no hidden background source ingestion;
- no autonomous notification loop without user-visible run records.', 'Caution', '2026-06-02-agent-scheduling-heartbeat-source-batch-signal', '2026-06-02-agent-scheduling-heartbeat-source-batch-signal#5');

