INSERT INTO chunks (id, document_id, ordinal, heading, text, hash, token_count)
VALUES (
  '2026-05-17-cli-vs-mcp-tool-selection-brief#6', '2026-05-17-cli-vs-mcp-tool-selection-brief', 6, 'Risks and caveats',
  '## Risks and caveats

- Token numbers in the video are useful as intuition, not stable facts.
- CLI can be unsafe when it gives agents broad shell access, poor auditability or direct secret access.
- MCP can be unsafe when servers expose too much authority, too many tools or unclear trust boundaries.
- Current MCP authorization behavior is evolving; standards should include a recheck date.', '65d736315e58e69aea44ee10d18e27ab9029a38b1ad73db8c596da75f43a1d5f', 90
);
INSERT INTO chunks_fts (text, heading, document_id, chunk_id)
VALUES ('## Risks and caveats

- Token numbers in the video are useful as intuition, not stable facts.
- CLI can be unsafe when it gives agents broad shell access, poor auditability or direct secret access.
- MCP can be unsafe when servers expose too much authority, too many tools or unclear trust boundaries.
- Current MCP authorization behavior is evolving; standards should include a recheck date.', 'Risks and caveats', '2026-05-17-cli-vs-mcp-tool-selection-brief', '2026-05-17-cli-vs-mcp-tool-selection-brief#6');

INSERT INTO chunks (id, document_id, ordinal, heading, text, hash, token_count)
VALUES (
  '2026-05-17-cli-vs-mcp-tool-selection-brief#7', '2026-05-17-cli-vs-mcp-tool-selection-brief', 7, 'Recommendation',
  '## Recommendation

Promote the combined Skills/MCP/CLI guidance to a draft standard. The standard should require pre-flight interface selection before adding tools to a new agent:

- Prefer CLI/script when a local command is deterministic, safe and maps directly to the job.
- Prefer skill when the missing piece is repeatable procedure, not a new external capability.
- Prefer MCP when auth, governance, shared service access, rendering, remote execution or durable protocol boundaries matter.
- Limit MCP toolsets/tools whenever possible.', 'd36d457b2f47c1c42fa7e23e63afcfb994943b4f28ec6113aaec4c012bba081a', 107
);
INSERT INTO chunks_fts (text, heading, document_id, chunk_id)
VALUES ('## Recommendation

Promote the combined Skills/MCP/CLI guidance to a draft standard. The standard should require pre-flight interface selection before adding tools to a new agent:

- Prefer CLI/script when a local command is deterministic, safe and maps directly to the job.
- Prefer skill when the missing piece is repeatable procedure, not a new external capability.
- Prefer MCP when auth, governance, shared service access, rendering, remote execution or durable protocol boundaries matter.
- Limit MCP toolsets/tools whenever possible.', 'Recommendation', '2026-05-17-cli-vs-mcp-tool-selection-brief', '2026-05-17-cli-vs-mcp-tool-selection-brief#7');

