VALUES ('# Brief: Codex mobile access to local sessions

Date: 2026-05-17
Status: draft', 'Brief: Codex mobile access to local sessions', '2026-05-17-codex-mobile-local-sessions-brief', '2026-05-17-codex-mobile-local-sessions-brief#1');

INSERT INTO chunks (id, document_id, ordinal, heading, text, hash, token_count)
VALUES (
  '2026-05-17-codex-mobile-local-sessions-brief#2', '2026-05-17-codex-mobile-local-sessions-brief', 2, 'Summary',
  '## Summary

Codex mobile access to local sessions is strategically important for Techscope. It means the user can monitor, steer, approve and continue work running on a laptop, Mac mini, devbox or remote environment from the ChatGPT mobile app. This can reduce the need for custom Telegram bridges for controlling active Codex work.

It does not remove the need for our Telegram intake bot. Telegram still solves a different job: capturing posts, links, screenshots and voice/media into the Techscope knowledge base.', '2d95ee4d071b803cd815e7f0146b49430f1467e18c738ce09f81bc15d8a82938', 110
);
INSERT INTO chunks_fts (text, heading, document_id, chunk_id)
VALUES ('## Summary

Codex mobile access to local sessions is strategically important for Techscope. It means the user can monitor, steer, approve and continue work running on a laptop, Mac mini, devbox or remote environment from the ChatGPT mobile app. This can reduce the need for custom Telegram bridges for controlling active Codex work.

It does not remove the need for our Telegram intake bot. Telegram still solves a different job: capturing posts, links, screenshots and voice/media into the Techscope knowledge base.', 'Summary', '2026-05-17-codex-mobile-local-sessions-brief', '2026-05-17-codex-mobile-local-sessions-brief#2');

INSERT INTO chunks (id, document_id, ordinal, heading, text, hash, token_count)
VALUES (
  '2026-05-17-codex-mobile-local-sessions-brief#3', '2026-05-17-codex-mobile-local-sessions-brief', 3, 'Key claims',
  '## Key claims

- Official Codex mobile support can connect to machines where Codex is running.
- Local files, credentials, permissions and setup stay on the host machine.
- Mobile receives live session state and outputs.
- A secure relay is used instead of directly exposing the local host to the public internet.
- Long-running local work now fits better on Mac mini/VM than on a sleeping laptop.
- Techscope should separate two flows:
  - control active Codex work through official Codex mobile;
  - ingest external knowledge through Telegram bot and media queues.', '45c839ae6a5e5625329d2d63a082a113e756810eec5263067ed59ea390aa74f2', 126
);
INSERT INTO chunks_fts (text, heading, document_id, chunk_id)
VALUES ('## Key claims

- Official Codex mobile support can connect to machines where Codex is running.
- Local files, credentials, permissions and setup stay on the host machine.
- Mobile receives live session state and outputs.
- A secure relay is used instead of directly exposing the local host to the public internet.
- Long-running local work now fits better on Mac mini/VM than on a sleeping laptop.
- Techscope should separate two flows:
  - control active Codex work through official Codex mobile;
  - ingest external knowledge through Telegram bot and media queues.', 'Key claims', '2026-05-17-codex-mobile-local-sessions-brief', '2026-05-17-codex-mobile-local-sessions-brief#3');

INSERT INTO chunks (id, document_id, ordinal, heading, text, hash, token_count)
VALUES (
  '2026-05-17-codex-mobile-local-sessions-brief#4', '2026-05-17-codex-mobile-local-sessions-brief', 4, 'Evidence',
  '## Evidence

- OpenAI article published 2026-05-14 confirms Codex in the ChatGPT mobile app and cross-device connection to local/remote machines.
- Telegram screenshot shows an active local Codex task with `Work locally`, project sidebar, live task progress, permission/model controls and mobile/remote affordance.', 'e2d664a478c10ff682dd29177320c55baeba21fd140593b8642cf7ce0d84d883', 57
);
INSERT INTO chunks_fts (text, heading, document_id, chunk_id)
VALUES ('## Evidence

- OpenAI article published 2026-05-14 confirms Codex in the ChatGPT mobile app and cross-device connection to local/remote machines.
- Telegram screenshot shows an active local Codex task with `Work locally`, project sidebar, live task progress, permission/model controls and mobile/remote affordance.', 'Evidence', '2026-05-17-codex-mobile-local-sessions-brief', '2026-05-17-codex-mobile-local-sessions-brief#4');

INSERT INTO chunks (id, document_id, ordinal, heading, text, hash, token_count)
VALUES (
  '2026-05-17-codex-mobile-local-sessions-brief#5', '2026-05-17-codex-mobile-local-sessions-brief', 5, 'Risks and caveats',
  '## Risks and caveats

- Preview/current product behavior can change quickly.
- Host availability matters: laptop sleep or network loss breaks the local-session workflow.
- Security review is required for device trust, account access, local permission mode and relay behavior.
- Official mobile access should not be treated as a data-ingestion pipeline; Telegram intake remains the better capture surface.', 'd902f0ee314a5b2a031ffd26bb9f7bf127b8135e7746c9c8240bd8d295364aae', 80
);
INSERT INTO chunks_fts (text, heading, document_id, chunk_id)
VALUES ('## Risks and caveats

- Preview/current product behavior can change quickly.
- Host availability matters: laptop sleep or network loss breaks the local-session workflow.
- Security review is required for device trust, account access, local permission mode and relay behavior.
- Official mobile access should not be treated as a data-ingestion pipeline; Telegram intake remains the better capture surface.', 'Risks and caveats', '2026-05-17-codex-mobile-local-sessions-brief', '2026-05-17-codex-mobile-local-sessions-brief#5');

INSERT INTO chunks (id, document_id, ordinal, heading, text, hash, token_count)
VALUES (
  '2026-05-17-codex-mobile-local-sessions-brief#6', '2026-05-17-codex-mobile-local-sessions-brief', 6, 'Recommendation',
  '## Recommendation

Experiment soon on our Mac mini setup:

- confirm mobile app sees active local Codex sessions;
- confirm approval prompts and screenshots are usable on phone;
- test host sleep prevention;
- compare with our Telegram bridge assumptions;
- decide whether any Techscope operations should move from Telegram control to official Codex mobile.', '2448fb035eb0b52fd27425fd84194059894635bb9d8395c74b7c2ebddb636d1e', 75
);
