INSERT INTO chunks (id, document_id, ordinal, heading, text, hash, token_count)
VALUES (
  '2026-05-17-hermes-agent-setup-brief#2', '2026-05-17-hermes-agent-setup-brief', 2, 'Summary',
  '## Summary

The video is useful as a hands-on setup walkthrough for Hermes Agent as an always-on personal agent: VPS or Mac mini, Docker/service persistence, provider keys, Telegram bot, gateway pairing and command approvals. It does not replace official docs and should not be treated as proof that Hermes supersedes OpenClaw.

For Techscope, the main value is not the Hostinger path itself. The value is the deployment pattern: start with a working CLI agent, add provider configuration, then expose it through a controlled messaging gateway, with persistent storage and explicit authorization.', '76a1c408a5f4efa3249791e1c8e8e0158c5b2ffac348772312c1e252969f3f29', 123
);
INSERT INTO chunks_fts (text, heading, document_id, chunk_id)
VALUES ('## Summary

The video is useful as a hands-on setup walkthrough for Hermes Agent as an always-on personal agent: VPS or Mac mini, Docker/service persistence, provider keys, Telegram bot, gateway pairing and command approvals. It does not replace official docs and should not be treated as proof that Hermes supersedes OpenClaw.

For Techscope, the main value is not the Hostinger path itself. The value is the deployment pattern: start with a working CLI agent, add provider configuration, then expose it through a controlled messaging gateway, with persistent storage and explicit authorization.', 'Summary', '2026-05-17-hermes-agent-setup-brief', '2026-05-17-hermes-agent-setup-brief#2');

INSERT INTO chunks (id, document_id, ordinal, heading, text, hash, token_count)
VALUES (
  '2026-05-17-hermes-agent-setup-brief#3', '2026-05-17-hermes-agent-setup-brief', 3, 'Key claims',
  '## Key claims

- Always-on autonomous agents benefit from a server-like runtime rather than being tied to a laptop session.
- Persistent Docker volumes or equivalent service storage are important because memory, skills, session history and config are part of the agent''s accumulated capability.
- Telegram is a practical control surface for a personal agent, but it must be paired/authorized and guarded.
- Provider routing via OpenRouter and direct provider keys can make model choice flexible, but it increases secret-management and cost-control requirements.
- Hermes'' self-improving skills and memory loop are the core reason to study it, but exact skill counts, model defaults and install details change quickly.
- The safest setup order is: working CLI chat, model/provider check, gateway setup, Telegram pairing, command approval checks, then automation.', 'a08d884a98151fcc2f07c561ad24f89f6a06de0d98b95bfd5f48f9e4ec47fc3e', 173
);
INSERT INTO chunks_fts (text, heading, document_id, chunk_id)
VALUES ('## Key claims

- Always-on autonomous agents benefit from a server-like runtime rather than being tied to a laptop session.
- Persistent Docker volumes or equivalent service storage are important because memory, skills, session history and config are part of the agent''s accumulated capability.
- Telegram is a practical control surface for a personal agent, but it must be paired/authorized and guarded.
- Provider routing via OpenRouter and direct provider keys can make model choice flexible, but it increases secret-management and cost-control requirements.
- Hermes'' self-improving skills and memory loop are the core reason to study it, but exact skill counts, model defaults and install details change quickly.
- The safest setup order is: working CLI chat, model/provider check, gateway setup, Telegram pairing, command approval checks, then automation.', 'Key claims', '2026-05-17-hermes-agent-setup-brief', '2026-05-17-hermes-agent-setup-brief#3');

INSERT INTO chunks (id, document_id, ordinal, heading, text, hash, token_count)
VALUES (
  '2026-05-17-hermes-agent-setup-brief#4', '2026-05-17-hermes-agent-setup-brief', 4, 'Agent environment profile',
  '## Agent environment profile

- Model context: OpenRouter, direct provider keys, local/self-hosted models as future path.
- Runtime environment: VPS, Docker, terminal, CLI, messaging gateway, Telegram; Mac mini is a plausible Techscope-hosted analog.
- Config surfaces: `.env`, `config.yaml`, `hermes setup`, `hermes model`, `hermes gateway`, provider keys, Telegram bot token, skills.
- Portability: adapter-needed.', '993e0eec6687239ebde7d80d080b573e32cebc32f65144f65e9d0191c787190b', 72
);
