  inference backend, serving parameters, timeout and hardware.
- A local harness that wins on coding tasks may still be wrong for a voice,
  Telegram, media-ingestion or long-running operations agent.', 'Risks and caveats', '2026-05-27-local-harness-benchmark-brief', '2026-05-27-local-harness-benchmark-brief#7');

INSERT INTO chunks (id, document_id, ordinal, heading, text, hash, token_count)
VALUES (
  '2026-05-27-local-harness-benchmark-brief#8', '2026-05-27-local-harness-benchmark-brief', 8, 'Recommendation',
  '## Recommendation

Create a draft standard: `agent-harness-evaluation`. Future Agents Mother
contracts should require an evaluation plan before choosing an external harness
or switching from Codex-native to OpenCode/Pi/Hermes/OpenClaw-style runtimes.', '2be56a6973b48cd1b81db06a259b911daf4a40bacc69cca7f2f6dfd98f0dd936', 38
);
INSERT INTO chunks_fts (text, heading, document_id, chunk_id)
VALUES ('## Recommendation

Create a draft standard: `agent-harness-evaluation`. Future Agents Mother
contracts should require an evaluation plan before choosing an external harness
or switching from Codex-native to OpenCode/Pi/Hermes/OpenClaw-style runtimes.', 'Recommendation', '2026-05-27-local-harness-benchmark-brief', '2026-05-27-local-harness-benchmark-brief#8');

