VALUES ('## Options

- One universal `AGENTS.md` only.
- Separate per-tool files only.
- Common Techscope source of truth plus environment-specific adapters.', 'Options', '2026-05-17-agent-environment-configuration-portability', '2026-05-17-agent-environment-configuration-portability#3');

INSERT INTO chunks (id, document_id, ordinal, heading, text, hash, token_count)
VALUES (
  '2026-05-17-agent-environment-configuration-portability#4', '2026-05-17-agent-environment-configuration-portability', 4, 'Comparison',
  '## Comparison

| Option | Strengths | Weaknesses | Fit |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| Universal `AGENTS.md` only | Simple, portable starting point, aligns with emerging practice. | Loses tool-specific features and loading behavior. | Good baseline, insufficient alone. |
| Per-tool files only | Uses every environment''s native features. | Fragments source of truth and causes drift. | Useful for generated adapters, weak as primary memory. |
| Common source of truth plus adapters | Keeps Techscope coherent while preserving platform differences. | Requires explicit mapping and maintenance. | Best fit. |', 'ccbbd8cf35ea596dfa1dadbb09691b0a13d921095b3fe563cd9fb697dbdabfc8', 134
);
INSERT INTO chunks_fts (text, heading, document_id, chunk_id)
VALUES ('## Comparison

| Option | Strengths | Weaknesses | Fit |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| Universal `AGENTS.md` only | Simple, portable starting point, aligns with emerging practice. | Loses tool-specific features and loading behavior. | Good baseline, insufficient alone. |
| Per-tool files only | Uses every environment''s native features. | Fragments source of truth and causes drift. | Useful for generated adapters, weak as primary memory. |
| Common source of truth plus adapters | Keeps Techscope coherent while preserving platform differences. | Requires explicit mapping and maintenance. | Best fit. |', 'Comparison', '2026-05-17-agent-environment-configuration-portability', '2026-05-17-agent-environment-configuration-portability#4');

INSERT INTO chunks (id, document_id, ordinal, heading, text, hash, token_count)
VALUES (
  '2026-05-17-agent-environment-configuration-portability#5', '2026-05-17-agent-environment-configuration-portability', 5, 'Agent environment profile',
  '## Agent environment profile

- Agent platforms: Codex, Claude Code, Gemini CLI, GitHub Copilot, Cursor, Windsurf.
- Model context: GPT-5.3-Codex/GPT-5.5 class models, Claude Code, Gemini, Copilot-backed agents.
- Runtime environment: CLI, desktop app, IDE, cloud agent, GitHub, terminal.
- Config surfaces: `AGENTS.md`, `CLAUDE.md`, `GEMINI.md`, `.cursor/rules`, `.github/copilot-instructions.md`, `.windsurf/rules`, skills, MCP, hooks, plugins, subagents, memories.
- Portability: adapter-needed.
- Codex adaptation: keep `AGENTS.md` and Techscope Markdown as source of truth; translate external patterns into Codex workflows/skills/scripts when useful.
- Environment-specific caveats: Claude hooks/subagent memory, Gemini hierarchical memory, Cursor rule activation, Copilot instruction ordering and Windsurf memories are not Codex-native behaviors.', '0a8d5eeef58a4424632b5a6d0e323d6ed7cd9b46af07bbd4bc21a8c48f0a2763', 133
);
