Self-improving skills and auto-written memory must be reviewed like executable supply chain.', 'Security', '2026-05-17-agent-shell-evaluation-review', '2026-05-17-agent-shell-evaluation-review#9');

INSERT INTO chunks (id, document_id, ordinal, heading, text, hash, token_count)
VALUES (
  '2026-05-17-agent-shell-evaluation-review#10', '2026-05-17-agent-shell-evaluation-review', 10, 'Developer Experience',
  '### Developer Experience

For developers, CLI/app surfaces and source-controlled harness files are acceptable. For non-coders, the correct interface is usually Telegram/web/app plus concise human-readable results. Do not expose implementation paths, queue ids and technical logs as the primary user-facing response.', '36eb5a090de0f5df2e09621d7fbec9940ece3219f0c1593d31ef4f2dc625ed27', 54
);
