VALUES (
  '2026-05-17-codbash-agent-session-browser-assessment#7', '2026-05-17-codbash-agent-session-browser-assessment', 7, 'Security',
  '### Security

Sensitive. A dashboard that reads local session logs may expose prompts, code paths, filenames, outputs, costs and possibly secrets. Keep it local, inspect storage/network behavior and avoid remote exposure until reviewed.', '298ddd7f4b2ec462e57fc282137e392bf0799a626060f6fefcca7cc5f52ffb10', 45
);
