INSERT INTO chunks (id, document_id, ordinal, heading, text, hash, token_count)
VALUES (
  '2026-05-17-mimiclaw-embedded-agent-assessment#8', '2026-05-17-mimiclaw-embedded-agent-assessment', 8, 'Architecture',
  '### Architecture

MimiClaw is valuable because it makes agent boundaries explicit. It has to separate channel polling, message queues, agent loop, tools, memory, sessions and outbound dispatch because the device cannot hide complexity behind a large runtime. This is a good pattern library for minimal agents.', 'eed9b0fbaa179daeee66a9b2c71500d06610f485693690c65887ecdd2c876f03', 63
);
INSERT INTO chunks_fts (text, heading, document_id, chunk_id)
VALUES ('### Architecture

MimiClaw is valuable because it makes agent boundaries explicit. It has to separate channel polling, message queues, agent loop, tools, memory, sessions and outbound dispatch because the device cannot hide complexity behind a large runtime. This is a good pattern library for minimal agents.', 'Architecture', '2026-05-17-mimiclaw-embedded-agent-assessment', '2026-05-17-mimiclaw-embedded-agent-assessment#8');

INSERT INTO chunks (id, document_id, ordinal, heading, text, hash, token_count)
VALUES (
  '2026-05-17-mimiclaw-embedded-agent-assessment#9', '2026-05-17-mimiclaw-embedded-agent-assessment', 9, 'Security',
  '### Security

The current risk is high. The project TODO says Telegram allowlist is still missing, and the device stores credentials for WiFi, Telegram and cloud LLM APIs. Before any experiment, use a throwaway bot, low-limit API key, isolated network, no sensitive memory and verified firmware/update path.', '8d71f2a93d662491a0f9ee9fbaf0278b77e43ae84937ad423fd0c1dc18f104f7', 64
);
INSERT INTO chunks_fts (text, heading, document_id, chunk_id)
VALUES ('### Security

The current risk is high. The project TODO says Telegram allowlist is still missing, and the device stores credentials for WiFi, Telegram and cloud LLM APIs. Before any experiment, use a throwaway bot, low-limit API key, isolated network, no sensitive memory and verified firmware/update path.', 'Security', '2026-05-17-mimiclaw-embedded-agent-assessment', '2026-05-17-mimiclaw-embedded-agent-assessment#9');

INSERT INTO chunks (id, document_id, ordinal, heading, text, hash, token_count)
VALUES (
  '2026-05-17-mimiclaw-embedded-agent-assessment#10', '2026-05-17-mimiclaw-embedded-agent-assessment', 10, 'Developer Experience',
  '### Developer Experience

The setup is more fragile than server software: ESP-IDF, board variant, flash/PSRAM requirements, correct USB port and serial CLI all matter. This is not beginner-friendly unless we write a careful runbook.', 'cc68a5a792dadbdb18f9c51852e9282ad884d56d46f0ab5c14cb5aff9b2de7f4', 46
);
INSERT INTO chunks_fts (text, heading, document_id, chunk_id)
VALUES ('### Developer Experience

The setup is more fragile than server software: ESP-IDF, board variant, flash/PSRAM requirements, correct USB port and serial CLI all matter. This is not beginner-friendly unless we write a careful runbook.', 'Developer Experience', '2026-05-17-mimiclaw-embedded-agent-assessment', '2026-05-17-mimiclaw-embedded-agent-assessment#10');

INSERT INTO chunks (id, document_id, ordinal, heading, text, hash, token_count)
VALUES (
  '2026-05-17-mimiclaw-embedded-agent-assessment#11', '2026-05-17-mimiclaw-embedded-agent-assessment', 11, 'Product Pragmatist',
  '### Product Pragmatist

MimiClaw is not useful for Techscope''s current knowledge-base workflow. It is useful for future always-on physical assistants, lab devices, sensor/actuator agents, low-power notification agents or agent appliances.', 'f70f2a0c13ecc46a74286a6c77d2150fe30c144b459c5d93c6823f1d109d49a7', 41
);
INSERT INTO chunks_fts (text, heading, document_id, chunk_id)
VALUES ('### Product Pragmatist

MimiClaw is not useful for Techscope''s current knowledge-base workflow. It is useful for future always-on physical assistants, lab devices, sensor/actuator agents, low-power notification agents or agent appliances.', 'Product Pragmatist', '2026-05-17-mimiclaw-embedded-agent-assessment', '2026-05-17-mimiclaw-embedded-agent-assessment#11');

INSERT INTO chunks (id, document_id, ordinal, heading, text, hash, token_count)
VALUES (
  '2026-05-17-mimiclaw-embedded-agent-assessment#12', '2026-05-17-mimiclaw-embedded-agent-assessment', 12, 'Research Scout',
  '### Research Scout

Primary sources are available and the project has meaningful traction, but it is early. The repo''s latest release is v0.1.1 and docs are internally inconsistent in places, so local verification is required before claims become standards.', '1820d2517caa2cc961c4dfbc1a44ee0fcc5d7646320943dac4dbf35fc64e375e', 53
);
