numbers should not be accepted as facts without project-specific measurement.', 'One-paragraph read', '2026-05-26-openclaw-local-inference-cost-assessment', '2026-05-26-openclaw-local-inference-cost-assessment#2');

INSERT INTO chunks (id, document_id, ordinal, heading, text, hash, token_count)
VALUES (
  '2026-05-26-openclaw-local-inference-cost-assessment#3', '2026-05-26-openclaw-local-inference-cost-assessment', 3, 'Why it matters',
  '## Why it matters

Agents Mother is already creating agents with voice, memory, media ingestion and
semantic search. Those systems can create recurring model spend. A runtime
placement policy lets us design cost and privacy into the harness instead of
discovering the bill later.', '8a144d510245d9f1326ebf160253a09ea4b5d4ce8b90eeae705ad2e8371d68c8', 60
);
INSERT INTO chunks_fts (text, heading, document_id, chunk_id)
VALUES ('## Why it matters

