INSERT INTO chunks (id, document_id, ordinal, heading, text, hash, token_count)
VALUES (
  '2026-05-27-hermes-agent-team-operating-model-assessment#2', '2026-05-27-hermes-agent-team-operating-model-assessment', 2, 'One-paragraph read',
  '## One-paragraph read

The video is useful as an operating-model example: treat a mature personal agent
setup as a team with roles, skills, schedules and feedback loops. It does not
prove Hermes is universally better, and it does not give us a template to copy.
It does add concrete design questions for Agents Mother: when to split roles,
how to route work, how to schedule reports, how to preserve daily memory and how
to prevent proactive agents from becoming noise.', 'f76a58961102206cae43830a62e86bce42362d16cfd1d891c7492fbc7a1bec1c', 108
);
INSERT INTO chunks_fts (text, heading, document_id, chunk_id)
VALUES ('## One-paragraph read

The video is useful as an operating-model example: treat a mature personal agent
setup as a team with roles, skills, schedules and feedback loops. It does not
prove Hermes is universally better, and it does not give us a template to copy.
It does add concrete design questions for Agents Mother: when to split roles,
how to route work, how to schedule reports, how to preserve daily memory and how
to prevent proactive agents from becoming noise.', 'One-paragraph read', '2026-05-27-hermes-agent-team-operating-model-assessment', '2026-05-27-hermes-agent-team-operating-model-assessment#2');

INSERT INTO chunks (id, document_id, ordinal, heading, text, hash, token_count)
VALUES (
  '2026-05-27-hermes-agent-team-operating-model-assessment#3', '2026-05-27-hermes-agent-team-operating-model-assessment', 3, 'Why it matters',
  '## Why it matters

We are building agents that may grow beyond one chat interface. Without a team
model, they become one large prompt with too many tools and too much memory. A
role-based operating model gives us a cleaner way to design specialist agents,
sidecar workers and scheduled routines.', '589986a77a0e82417f013e15fe8fe27275c882c5ab6b86a26c43bff6d850fe0b', 68
);
INSERT INTO chunks_fts (text, heading, document_id, chunk_id)
VALUES ('## Why it matters

We are building agents that may grow beyond one chat interface. Without a team
model, they become one large prompt with too many tools and too much memory. A
