4. Re-run `pritha evolve .` after this review to capture the roadmap as a lifecycle lesson.', 'Promotion Path', '2026-05-28-techscope-quality-and-release-pattern-review', '2026-05-28-techscope-quality-and-release-pattern-review#13');

