- Keep Pritha default simple: eager manifests for small agents, discovery layers
  only for tool-heavy or enterprise-facing agents.', 'Recommendation', '2026-06-01-agent-connectivity-stack-update-assessment', '2026-06-01-agent-connectivity-stack-update-assessment#14');

