INSERT INTO chunks (id, document_id, ordinal, heading, text, hash, token_count)
VALUES (
  '2026-06-02-agent-harness-engineering-source-batch-review#5', '2026-06-02-agent-harness-engineering-source-batch-review', 5, 'Long-Running Handoff',
  '### Long-Running Handoff

Long-running agents fail when each context window starts cold or when the agent
tries to complete too much at once. The portable pattern is to initialize the
project with:

- structured feature/task list;
- progress log;
- git commit history;
- init/run script;
- basic health or smoke test;
- instruction to make one bounded increment;
- clean-state handoff at the end of every session.', 'f6007a059f0a20a99f469623ebbcbbbd34673f017239c46522985fe41b3cef69', 92
);
INSERT INTO chunks_fts (text, heading, document_id, chunk_id)
VALUES ('### Long-Running Handoff

Long-running agents fail when each context window starts cold or when the agent
tries to complete too much at once. The portable pattern is to initialize the
project with:

- structured feature/task list;
- progress log;
- git commit history;
- init/run script;
- basic health or smoke test;
- instruction to make one bounded increment;
- clean-state handoff at the end of every session.', 'Long-Running Handoff', '2026-06-02-agent-harness-engineering-source-batch-review', '2026-06-02-agent-harness-engineering-source-batch-review#5');

INSERT INTO chunks (id, document_id, ordinal, heading, text, hash, token_count)
VALUES (
  '2026-06-02-agent-harness-engineering-source-batch-review#6', '2026-06-02-agent-harness-engineering-source-batch-review', 6, 'Outcome-Based Evals',
  '### Outcome-Based Evals

Agent evals should grade final environment state, not only text. A task can have
multiple trials, graders and assertions. A transcript/trace records the path,
but the outcome is the state after the run. This maps well to Pritha scaffold
reports, smoke tests, healthchecks and hidden graders.', '4f7da2f009fc26205b91e78dab637ee56b37609f4c2ddc33be01b2959c8a9305', 67
);
INSERT INTO chunks_fts (text, heading, document_id, chunk_id)
VALUES ('### Outcome-Based Evals

Agent evals should grade final environment state, not only text. A task can have
multiple trials, graders and assertions. A transcript/trace records the path,
but the outcome is the state after the run. This maps well to Pritha scaffold
reports, smoke tests, healthchecks and hidden graders.', 'Outcome-Based Evals', '2026-06-02-agent-harness-engineering-source-batch-review', '2026-06-02-agent-harness-engineering-source-batch-review#6');

INSERT INTO chunks (id, document_id, ordinal, heading, text, hash, token_count)
VALUES (
  '2026-06-02-agent-harness-engineering-source-batch-review#7', '2026-06-02-agent-harness-engineering-source-batch-review', 7, 'Trace-Driven Improvement',
  '### Trace-Driven Improvement

Harness changes should be driven by traces and failure taxonomy:

- tool-call errors;
- timeout or loop patterns;
- missing context;
- early stopping;
- skipped verification;
- model/provider-specific tool mistakes;
- user correction signals.

Repeated failures should become rules, tests, skills, middleware, status
commands or scaffold changes.', 'c6152ed1985e59d1e7d63ca2f60e556fdc5bed7e4041daf8cac18383a7c31d87', 69
);
INSERT INTO chunks_fts (text, heading, document_id, chunk_id)
VALUES ('### Trace-Driven Improvement

Harness changes should be driven by traces and failure taxonomy:

- tool-call errors;
- timeout or loop patterns;
- missing context;
- early stopping;
- skipped verification;
- model/provider-specific tool mistakes;
- user correction signals.

Repeated failures should become rules, tests, skills, middleware, status
commands or scaffold changes.', 'Trace-Driven Improvement', '2026-06-02-agent-harness-engineering-source-batch-review', '2026-06-02-agent-harness-engineering-source-batch-review#7');

INSERT INTO chunks (id, document_id, ordinal, heading, text, hash, token_count)
VALUES (
  '2026-06-02-agent-harness-engineering-source-batch-review#8', '2026-06-02-agent-harness-engineering-source-batch-review', 8, 'Feedforward And Feedback',
  '### Feedforward And Feedback

Pritha should distinguish:

- feedforward guides: AGENTS.md, standards, skills, architecture docs,
  constraints, examples;
- feedback sensors: tests, linters, type checks, browser checks, logs, traces,
  review agents, runtime metrics.

Computational controls are deterministic and cheap. Inferential controls are
semantic, slower and probabilistic. Use both, but keep human judgment for
behavioral correctness where automated signals are weak.', 'e9a33c2383490b0e4c3b763a32f9ba8110505a1c7f3bff9cd216315cdc1a9fea', 80
);
INSERT INTO chunks_fts (text, heading, document_id, chunk_id)
VALUES ('### Feedforward And Feedback

Pritha should distinguish:

- feedforward guides: AGENTS.md, standards, skills, architecture docs,
  constraints, examples;
- feedback sensors: tests, linters, type checks, browser checks, logs, traces,
  review agents, runtime metrics.

Computational controls are deterministic and cheap. Inferential controls are
semantic, slower and probabilistic. Use both, but keep human judgment for
behavioral correctness where automated signals are weak.', 'Feedforward And Feedback', '2026-06-02-agent-harness-engineering-source-batch-review', '2026-06-02-agent-harness-engineering-source-batch-review#8');

INSERT INTO chunks (id, document_id, ordinal, heading, text, hash, token_count)
VALUES (
  '2026-06-02-agent-harness-engineering-source-batch-review#9', '2026-06-02-agent-harness-engineering-source-batch-review', 9, 'Model-Specific Harness Tuning',
  '### Model-Specific Harness Tuning

Different models may prefer different tool formats, prompt styles, context
management and verification loops. Pritha should record harness/model
compatibility as version-bound evidence and avoid assuming one scaffold is
optimal for every model.', '36ce377c4e0e8a2cdcf0b3983fa1ecef03020cce017fcdeddf744ca8e02c1662', 49
);
INSERT INTO chunks_fts (text, heading, document_id, chunk_id)
VALUES ('### Model-Specific Harness Tuning

Different models may prefer different tool formats, prompt styles, context
management and verification loops. Pritha should record harness/model
