INSERT INTO chunks (id, document_id, ordinal, heading, text, hash, token_count)
VALUES (
  '2026-06-02-remote-mcp-source-batch-review#5', '2026-06-02-remote-mcp-source-batch-review', 5, 'Remote MCP Boundary',
  '### Remote MCP Boundary

Remote MCP is a service integration. It must record:

- server URL and owner;
- transport;
- auth method;
- credential storage;
- network path;
- data scope;
- side-effect scope;
- logging/audit location;
- fallback.', '639226ed7f4cf3e5ba7071471fa5b3df38cac766557cb9946673c4f7da9fc9a2', 54
);
INSERT INTO chunks_fts (text, heading, document_id, chunk_id)
VALUES ('### Remote MCP Boundary

Remote MCP is a service integration. It must record:

- server URL and owner;
- transport;
- auth method;
- credential storage;
- network path;
- data scope;
- side-effect scope;
- logging/audit location;
- fallback.', 'Remote MCP Boundary', '2026-06-02-remote-mcp-source-batch-review', '2026-06-02-remote-mcp-source-batch-review#5');

INSERT INTO chunks (id, document_id, ordinal, heading, text, hash, token_count)
VALUES (
  '2026-06-02-remote-mcp-source-batch-review#6', '2026-06-02-remote-mcp-source-batch-review', 6, 'Registry And Catalog Policy',
  '### Registry And Catalog Policy

Use registries and catalogs for discovery only. Official registries, GitHub MCP
Registry, Docker MCP Catalog and vendor docs can help find candidates, but
candidate servers still need provenance, package/image, license, maintainer,
toolset, auth and side-effect review.', 'ce77084306ff9c087221faf3580e9b23ad8c8d8e20b014eb86371f0933cb2d6b', 56
);
INSERT INTO chunks_fts (text, heading, document_id, chunk_id)
VALUES ('### Registry And Catalog Policy

Use registries and catalogs for discovery only. Official registries, GitHub MCP
Registry, Docker MCP Catalog and vendor docs can help find candidates, but
candidate servers still need provenance, package/image, license, maintainer,
toolset, auth and side-effect review.', 'Registry And Catalog Policy', '2026-06-02-remote-mcp-source-batch-review', '2026-06-02-remote-mcp-source-batch-review#6');

INSERT INTO chunks (id, document_id, ordinal, heading, text, hash, token_count)
VALUES (
  '2026-06-02-remote-mcp-source-batch-review#7', '2026-06-02-remote-mcp-source-batch-review', 7, 'Tool Poisoning Review',
  '### Tool Poisoning Review

Before enabling an external MCP server, inspect the full tool definition:
description, parameter names, schemas, enums, examples, prompts/resources and
dynamic tool list behavior. Record a hash/fingerprint when possible and treat
tool-list changes as drift that requires re-review.', '7a61503b54f226a78a4fab38a654721e604d40cb967d1e83c8d1d85a6874007b', 56
);
INSERT INTO chunks_fts (text, heading, document_id, chunk_id)
VALUES ('### Tool Poisoning Review

Before enabling an external MCP server, inspect the full tool definition:
description, parameter names, schemas, enums, examples, prompts/resources and
dynamic tool list behavior. Record a hash/fingerprint when possible and treat
tool-list changes as drift that requires re-review.', 'Tool Poisoning Review', '2026-06-02-remote-mcp-source-batch-review', '2026-06-02-remote-mcp-source-batch-review#7');

INSERT INTO chunks (id, document_id, ordinal, heading, text, hash, token_count)
VALUES (
  '2026-06-02-remote-mcp-source-batch-review#8', '2026-06-02-remote-mcp-source-batch-review', 8, 'Context And Code Execution',
  '### Context And Code Execution

When tool count is high, avoid loading every schema eagerly. Prefer:

- manifest or tool search;
- narrow allowlists;
- progressive discovery;
- sandboxed code/API composition for multi-tool work;
- filtered outputs before model context.', 'b498b3a8a4bceadbe79ad0c63d62f8e98140fb855843cde4800dc4606f5a1d06', 54
);
INSERT INTO chunks_fts (text, heading, document_id, chunk_id)
VALUES ('### Context And Code Execution

When tool count is high, avoid loading every schema eagerly. Prefer:

- manifest or tool search;
- narrow allowlists;
- progressive discovery;
- sandboxed code/API composition for multi-tool work;
- filtered outputs before model context.', 'Context And Code Execution', '2026-06-02-remote-mcp-source-batch-review', '2026-06-02-remote-mcp-source-batch-review#8');

INSERT INTO chunks (id, document_id, ordinal, heading, text, hash, token_count)
VALUES (
  '2026-06-02-remote-mcp-source-batch-review#9', '2026-06-02-remote-mcp-source-batch-review', 9, 'Techscope Adoption Check',
  '## Techscope Adoption Check

- Techscope/Agents Mother fit: adopt.
- Implementation cost: low for standards/workflow updates, medium for manifest
  fields, high for automated tool-definition scanner and drift monitor.
- Risk: external MCP can become hidden SaaS authority with broad tools,
  token-heavy schemas and prompt-injection surface.
- Decision: update MCP lifecycle standard and connector workflow now; defer
  automated MCP scanner until a child-agent contract selects external MCP.', 'e0dd0c42f8b5ef700821125c02fbba8243d1f57b3c4df394f102e9c83f201f1f', 90
);
INSERT INTO chunks_fts (text, heading, document_id, chunk_id)
VALUES ('## Techscope Adoption Check

- Techscope/Agents Mother fit: adopt.
- Implementation cost: low for standards/workflow updates, medium for manifest
  fields, high for automated tool-definition scanner and drift monitor.
- Risk: external MCP can become hidden SaaS authority with broad tools,
  token-heavy schemas and prompt-injection surface.
- Decision: update MCP lifecycle standard and connector workflow now; defer
  automated MCP scanner until a child-agent contract selects external MCP.', 'Techscope Adoption Check', '2026-06-02-remote-mcp-source-batch-review', '2026-06-02-remote-mcp-source-batch-review#9');

INSERT INTO chunks (id, document_id, ordinal, heading, text, hash, token_count)
VALUES (
  '2026-06-02-remote-mcp-source-batch-review#10', '2026-06-02-remote-mcp-source-batch-review', 10, 'Promotion Guidance',
  '## Promotion Guidance

Promote as principles:

- remote MCP is a network/auth boundary;
- registry/catalog discovery is not trust;
- tool definitions are untrusted input;
- dynamic tool drift requires audit;
- broad SaaS MCP needs approval gates;
- code-mode/MCP composition needs sandboxing.

Do not promote as defaults:

- installing from random registries;
- broad Zapier/app catalogs;
- all tools exposed by vendor MCP servers;
- code execution without sandbox;
- remote MCP for simple local workflows.', '1f400326e6109b42bf514fc0a443a2c141606c2d23c190f92b93471ea29a37a8', 104
);
INSERT INTO chunks_fts (text, heading, document_id, chunk_id)
VALUES ('## Promotion Guidance

Promote as principles:

- remote MCP is a network/auth boundary;
- registry/catalog discovery is not trust;
- tool definitions are untrusted input;
- dynamic tool drift requires audit;
- broad SaaS MCP needs approval gates;
- code-mode/MCP composition needs sandboxing.

Do not promote as defaults:

- installing from random registries;
- broad Zapier/app catalogs;
- all tools exposed by vendor MCP servers;
- code execution without sandbox;
- remote MCP for simple local workflows.', 'Promotion Guidance', '2026-06-02-remote-mcp-source-batch-review', '2026-06-02-remote-mcp-source-batch-review#10');

