- Config surfaces: `AGENTS.md`, `.pi`, settings, skills, extensions, prompt templates, package manifests.
- Portability: adapter-needed.
- Codex adaptation: use the architecture pattern in Pritha contracts; do not assume Pi package semantics inside Codex.
- Environment-specific caveats: extension hot reload and self-extension are local-trusted development conveniences, not production safety controls.', 'Agent environment profile', '2026-06-11-pi-agent-architecture-assessment', '2026-06-11-pi-agent-architecture-assessment#5');

