- Sibling child-agent folders should not inherit Techscope secrets, `.env`, `.queue`, `.logs`, `.memory-private` or private user state.', 'Layer 5: Infrastructure & Orchestration', 'agent-ai-safe-security-checklist', 'agent-ai-safe-security-checklist#11');

INSERT INTO chunks (id, document_id, ordinal, heading, text, hash, token_count)
VALUES (
  'agent-ai-safe-security-checklist#12', 'agent-ai-safe-security-checklist', 12, 'Minimal Readiness Labels',
  '## Minimal Readiness Labels

Use these labels in contract, scaffold and handoff reports:

| Label | Meaning |
| --- | --- |
| `selected-reviewed` | Layer is selected and controls are documented. |
| `selected-pending` | Layer is selected but auth, evals or implementation are not ready. |
| `selected-blocked` | Layer is selected but a safety blocker prevents scaffold readiness. |
| `skipped` | Layer is not selected for this agent. |
| `minimal` | Layer exists only as a low-risk local/manual boundary. |
| `unknown` | Needs follow-up before production use. |', '65a1ba5d1178ac0ac3be6b491efeed4f49325a27f95382c928c02313edb69273', 129
);
INSERT INTO chunks_fts (text, heading, document_id, chunk_id)
VALUES ('## Minimal Readiness Labels

Use these labels in contract, scaffold and handoff reports:

| Label | Meaning |
| --- | --- |
| `selected-reviewed` | Layer is selected and controls are documented. |
| `selected-pending` | Layer is selected but auth, evals or implementation are not ready. |
| `selected-blocked` | Layer is selected but a safety blocker prevents scaffold readiness. |
| `skipped` | Layer is not selected for this agent. |
| `minimal` | Layer exists only as a low-risk local/manual boundary. |
| `unknown` | Needs follow-up before production use. |', 'Minimal Readiness Labels', 'agent-ai-safe-security-checklist', 'agent-ai-safe-security-checklist#12');

INSERT INTO chunks (id, document_id, ordinal, heading, text, hash, token_count)
VALUES (
  'agent-ai-safe-security-checklist#13', 'agent-ai-safe-security-checklist', 13, 'Pritha Defaults',
  '## Pritha Defaults

- Default `ai_safe_profile`: `standard` for non-trivial child agents.
- Default for one-off local agents: `minimal`.
- Default external input status: untrusted until curated.
- Default memory writes from external input: disabled or approval-required.
- Default tool side effects: approval-required.
- Default proactivity: none/manual.
- Default service deployment: disabled.
- Default raw source retention: source-purged.', '1823f1fbdbfa670d30acd86e4f3fd7fe18da47164778c6cd155c3c0fee6da3e2', 77
);
