INSERT INTO chunks (id, document_id, ordinal, heading, text, hash, token_count)
VALUES (
  'agent-mcp-connector-lifecycle#15', 'agent-mcp-connector-lifecycle', 15, 'Scaffold Shape',
  '## Scaffold Shape

For a child agent that selects MCP, Pritha should create a small module:

```text
mcp/
  README.md
  manifest.json
  candidates.json
scripts/
  mcp-status.mjs
```

`mcp/manifest.json` is the source of truth for selected connectors. It should
record configured connectors, pending authentication, enabled toolsets and
approval gates. `mcp/candidates.json` is advisory and must not be treated as
active instructions.', '347bf8904b63f71744ed5551cabd6bf38650bf1cb77f1aa0c73f9cb39e89b41e', 76
);
