- A Telegram-facing agent can use the same task/session runtime as a CLI, but Telegram remains an interface adapter with queueing, approval and concise replies.
- A review side quest can run in a branch or separate session, summarize findings, then return to the main implementation path.', 'Examples', 'agent-minimal-core-extension-surface', 'agent-minimal-core-extension-surface#9');

