- Recheck when: browser microphone rules, OpenAI Realtime session events, WebRTC behavior, Codex task transport or mobile device support changes.', 'ad9eeddaab5686bbf9582b85ad07854049c0eda4475bf0af33506f2ad9d18232', 87
