- после `codex-review-done` intake переводится в `complete`.

Media-derived signal должен быть refined в Techscope thread перед тем, как становиться basis for brief, review, standard or decision.', 'Telegram media', 'signal-extraction', 'signal-extraction#9');

INSERT INTO chunks (id, document_id, ordinal, heading, text, hash, token_count)
VALUES (
  'signal-extraction#10', 'signal-extraction', 10, 'Non-goals',
  '## Non-goals

- Do not make signal a final decision.
- Do not replace primary-source verification.
- Do not store copyrighted full article or transcript text in signal.', '2c527557121a1bc53c28364b8c0585915c6e840668b9f6acbce9618e1d02388d', 38
);
