- Environment-specific caveats: Tailscale CLI syntax and Serve behavior can change; verify on the host before recording a URL as ready.', 'Agent environment compatibility', 'tailscale-private-device-access-for-local-agents', 'tailscale-private-device-access-for-local-agents#11');

