INSERT INTO chunks (id, document_id, ordinal, heading, text, hash, token_count)
VALUES (
  '2026-06-12-control-center-agents-page-roadmap#16', '2026-06-12-control-center-agents-page-roadmap', 16, 'C.16: Update Suggestions',
  '## C.16: Update Suggestions

Goal: add read-only update/drift intelligence.

Deliverables:

- Backend read model for update suggestions.
- Manual audit against profiles, contracts, manifests and reports.
- UI states:
  - `No updates`;
  - `Review suggested`;
  - `Manifest drift`;
  - `Profile stale`.
- No automatic update application.

Acceptance criteria:

- `Check for Updates` becomes enabled only when it has a safe backend.
- Suggestions explain evidence and next action.', '4aabf36dc6677494f98e3f9c9960da2aba697e12e27884928d499c0b636de3dc', 92
);
