INSERT INTO chunks (id, document_id, ordinal, heading, text, hash, token_count)
VALUES (
  '2026-06-12-control-center-voice-page-roadmap#16', '2026-06-12-control-center-voice-page-roadmap', 16, 'V.17: Decision Gates',
  '## V.17: Decision Gates

Goal: connect approval UI to real pending decisions.

Deliverables:

- Define decision types: memory write, file edit, Codex implementation,
  deployment/service change, publication, deletion and broad system change.
- Add backend state for pending decision, evidence, proposed action, risk and
  expiry.
- Require explicit approval for durable writes and system changes.
- Log decisions to private telemetry and, when appropriate, curated reports.

Acceptance criteria:

- Approve/Decline appears only when a concrete pending action exists.
- The voice model cannot treat a decorative approval card as real permission.', '36f0510c51d4d4103c1598b62e5e3c9c816ad590659cb589c1975978b185f01f', 122
);
INSERT INTO chunks_fts (text, heading, document_id, chunk_id)
VALUES ('## V.17: Decision Gates

Goal: connect approval UI to real pending decisions.

Deliverables:

- Define decision types: memory write, file edit, Codex implementation,
  deployment/service change, publication, deletion and broad system change.
- Add backend state for pending decision, evidence, proposed action, risk and
  expiry.
- Require explicit approval for durable writes and system changes.
- Log decisions to private telemetry and, when appropriate, curated reports.

Acceptance criteria:

- Approve/Decline appears only when a concrete pending action exists.
- The voice model cannot treat a decorative approval card as real permission.', 'V.17: Decision Gates', '2026-06-12-control-center-voice-page-roadmap', '2026-06-12-control-center-voice-page-roadmap#16');

INSERT INTO chunks (id, document_id, ordinal, heading, text, hash, token_count)
VALUES (
  '2026-06-12-control-center-voice-page-roadmap#17', '2026-06-12-control-center-voice-page-roadmap', 17, 'V.18: Observability And Recovery',
  '## V.18: Observability And Recovery

Goal: make debugging realtime/tool failures possible from the UI.

Deliverables:

- Add a developer details drawer for recent private telemetry events.
- Show realtime data-channel state, last error, provider error code and audio
  readiness.
- Show Codex mode, sandbox, timeout and write-enabled status.
- Add clear reasons for handoff skipped: `channel_closed`, `empty_result`,
  timeout or failed task.
- Add a manual `Refresh Task Status` action for task rows.

Acceptance criteria:

- After a failed voice test, the operator can tell whether the failure was
  microphone, realtime provider, data channel, tool execution, Codex task, task
  polling or result handoff.', '18f0040df7dbf5df6ac28faba3637716f5f2f46e71fd226c47fa2248890be9d8', 138
);
INSERT INTO chunks_fts (text, heading, document_id, chunk_id)
VALUES ('## V.18: Observability And Recovery

Goal: make debugging realtime/tool failures possible from the UI.

Deliverables:

- Add a developer details drawer for recent private telemetry events.
- Show realtime data-channel state, last error, provider error code and audio
  readiness.
- Show Codex mode, sandbox, timeout and write-enabled status.
- Add clear reasons for handoff skipped: `channel_closed`, `empty_result`,
  timeout or failed task.
- Add a manual `Refresh Task Status` action for task rows.

Acceptance criteria:

- After a failed voice test, the operator can tell whether the failure was
  microphone, realtime provider, data channel, tool execution, Codex task, task
  polling or result handoff.', 'V.18: Observability And Recovery', '2026-06-12-control-center-voice-page-roadmap', '2026-06-12-control-center-voice-page-roadmap#17');

INSERT INTO chunks (id, document_id, ordinal, heading, text, hash, token_count)
VALUES (
  '2026-06-12-control-center-voice-page-roadmap#18', '2026-06-12-control-center-voice-page-roadmap', 18, 'V.19: Mobile And Visual QA',
  '## V.19: Mobile And Visual QA

Goal: make the phone experience first-class.

Deliverables:

- Test `/voice` on desktop and mobile viewports after each visual change.
- Verify the Three.js star scene renders nonblank and remains framed.
- Keep transcript, task status and primary controls reachable on mobile.
- Avoid overflowing model/error/status text on narrow screens.
- Keep the visualizer expressive but secondary to task/session state.

Acceptance criteria:

- Mobile can start a call, inspect earlier turns, inspect Codex task status and
  promote a session summary without switching devices.', '211b80b30fcafb2e75e09ffae921e05c854edcd8077839f2bff7516309a28e88', 119
);
INSERT INTO chunks_fts (text, heading, document_id, chunk_id)
VALUES ('## V.19: Mobile And Visual QA

