record them as explicit, scoped, auditable harness modules rather than implicit
global tools.', 'Goal', 'agent-mcp-connector-selection', 'agent-mcp-connector-selection#2');

INSERT INTO chunks (id, document_id, ordinal, heading, text, hash, token_count)
VALUES (
  'agent-mcp-connector-selection#3', 'agent-mcp-connector-selection', 3, 'Inputs',
  '## Inputs

- Accepted or draft `agent-contract`.
- Mission, workflows, interfaces, tools, secrets, deployment and security needs.
- Candidate MCP servers from local memory, trusted docs or user request.', '19591f5e8926a3ca14fadbad6a04aff51d79ac70b8bb95d5c9c934e1aa588e16', 40
);
INSERT INTO chunks_fts (text, heading, document_id, chunk_id)
VALUES ('## Inputs

- Accepted or draft `agent-contract`.
- Mission, workflows, interfaces, tools, secrets, deployment and security needs.
