INSERT INTO chunks (id, document_id, ordinal, heading, text, hash, token_count)
VALUES (
  'llm-wiki-layer#6', 'llm-wiki-layer', 6, 'Ingest',
  '## Ingest

Use when a curated artifact should enrich generated wiki navigation.

Rules:

- Accept only curated Markdown artifacts.
- Reject raw-source holding areas.
- Extract frontmatter topics, tools, sources, related links and key sections.
- Create or update generated wiki pages in `10_wiki/pages/`.
- Rebuild `10_wiki/index.md`.
- Append an event to `10_wiki/log.md`.
- Never update standards or decisions directly.', '1f68102a207a8af125f4f2244c7793ea40165aa0581cd8f0c41d05732340cce9', 81
);
INSERT INTO chunks_fts (text, heading, document_id, chunk_id)
VALUES ('## Ingest

Use when a curated artifact should enrich generated wiki navigation.

Rules:

- Accept only curated Markdown artifacts.
- Reject raw-source holding areas.
- Extract frontmatter topics, tools, sources, related links and key sections.
- Create or update generated wiki pages in `10_wiki/pages/`.
- Rebuild `10_wiki/index.md`.
- Append an event to `10_wiki/log.md`.
- Never update standards or decisions directly.', 'Ingest', 'llm-wiki-layer', 'llm-wiki-layer#6');

INSERT INTO chunks (id, document_id, ordinal, heading, text, hash, token_count)
VALUES (
  'llm-wiki-layer#7', 'llm-wiki-layer', 7, 'Query',
  '## Query

Use when the user asks a conceptual question over generated wiki memory.

Rules:

- Start from `10_wiki/index.md`.
- Return matching generated pages and their source artifacts.
- Treat wiki pages as leads, not final evidence.
- If evidence is weak, point to the curated artifacts that must be opened.', '9b182046d4ad035bcdc5fe18e5f50a38a3f0f286662a9ba1ed96e1f71436896c', 69
);
