- `queue-health` stale items are informational unless they also appear in failed
  queues.
- Do not mutate queues automatically.
- Do not install launchd or schedule anything unless the user explicitly asks.', 'Run Techscope Self-Test', 'run-self-test-prompt', 'run-self-test-prompt#1');

