INSERT INTO chunks (id, document_id, ordinal, heading, text, hash, token_count)
VALUES (
  'telegram-intake-bot#4', 'telegram-intake-bot', 4, 'Configuration',
  '## Configuration

Use local environment variables:

```sh
TECHSCOPE_TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=...
TECHSCOPE_TELEGRAM_ALLOWED_USER_IDS=telegram-user
```

Keep secrets in `.env.local`. Do not commit bot tokens into Markdown, scripts or launchd plists.', 'f22958a57765321aaf90bd10e6706e31f7e80857b7132ac628a85b7545cc3a45', 34
);
