- Out of scope: building the adapter in Phase 12, voice interfaces, copying secrets, automatic Claude Code installation, or replacing `AGENTS.md` as Techscope''s source of truth.', 'Purpose', '2026-05-28-pritha-claude-code-adapter-agent-contract', '2026-05-28-pritha-claude-code-adapter-agent-contract#2');

