- Secondary: CLI maintenance scripts.
- Telegram: absent.
- Tailscale: used for trusted device access in local operator setup.', 'Interfaces', 'child-agent-profile-fespa26', 'child-agent-profile-fespa26#4');

INSERT INTO chunks (id, document_id, ordinal, heading, text, hash, token_count)
VALUES (
  'child-agent-profile-fespa26#5', 'child-agent-profile-fespa26', 5, 'Memory Model',
  '## Memory Model

- SQLite operational memory for sessions, turns, L1/L2 memory, FESPA sources,
  feed cards, jobs, publications and tool events.
- Raw uploads remain runtime state inside the child project and are not copied
  into Techscope profiles.', 'ecbdac6b61d91a86bbe0e53e8aa046a0797e44a2e63af0e252635ac1969ffef7', 52
);
INSERT INTO chunks_fts (text, heading, document_id, chunk_id)
VALUES ('## Memory Model

- SQLite operational memory for sessions, turns, L1/L2 memory, FESPA sources,
  feed cards, jobs, publications and tool events.
- Raw uploads remain runtime state inside the child project and are not copied
  into Techscope profiles.', 'Memory Model', 'child-agent-profile-fespa26', 'child-agent-profile-fespa26#5');

INSERT INTO chunks (id, document_id, ordinal, heading, text, hash, token_count)
VALUES (
  'child-agent-profile-fespa26#6', 'child-agent-profile-fespa26', 6, 'Tools',
  '## Tools

- OpenAI Realtime server/browser boundary.
- Realtime tool router.
- Codex App/thread transport where available.
- Codex CLI/local queue fallback.
- FESPA memory and feed APIs.', 'f3d30d6c6857845054c980da5c5b56ee443f9c57f5b86e85899e418b3008630b', 38
);
INSERT INTO chunks_fts (text, heading, document_id, chunk_id)
