| Memory manifest | missing | TechScope-generated agents should document memory profile and source of truth. |
| Tool manifest | missing | TechScope-generated agents should document tool boundaries. |
| Operations manifest | missing | TechScope-generated agents should document service mode, autostart policy, healthcheck and logs. |
| Env example | pass | .env.example should document required secrets without storing values. |
| Env secrets | pass | No .env file detected. |
| Smoke test | not-applicable | No smoke test found. |
| Interface status | not-applicable | No interface-status command found. |
| Memory status | not-applicable | No memory-status command found. |
| Tools status | not-applicable | No tools-status command found. |
| Operations status | not-applicable | No operations-status command found. |
| Deployment plan | not-applicable | No deploy-service command found. |
