INSERT INTO chunks (id, document_id, ordinal, heading, text, hash, token_count)
VALUES (
  '2026-05-28-pritha-realtime-tool-defaults-setup-report#2', '2026-05-28-pritha-realtime-tool-defaults-setup-report', 2, 'Summary',
  '## Summary

Clarified and implemented the setup rule for Pritha voice-control descendants:
when realtime voice is selected, the default realtime tool surface is internet
access, agent memory access and Codex CLI sidecar access.', '493af66735c4f7c2fce872c8f78e87713053173e1bfac79a0bbe637a341666b0', 45
);
INSERT INTO chunks_fts (text, heading, document_id, chunk_id)
VALUES ('## Summary

Clarified and implemented the setup rule for Pritha voice-control descendants:
when realtime voice is selected, the default realtime tool surface is internet
access, agent memory access and Codex CLI sidecar access.', 'Summary', '2026-05-28-pritha-realtime-tool-defaults-setup-report', '2026-05-28-pritha-realtime-tool-defaults-setup-report#2');

INSERT INTO chunks (id, document_id, ordinal, heading, text, hash, token_count)
VALUES (
  '2026-05-28-pritha-realtime-tool-defaults-setup-report#3', '2026-05-28-pritha-realtime-tool-defaults-setup-report', 3, 'Changes Made',
  '## Changes Made

- Added default realtime tools to `scripts/setup.mjs`: `internet`, `memory`,
  `codexCli`.
- Setup state now records `realtime.enabled`, `realtime.mode` and selected
  realtime tools.
- Setup sections now include `realtime.tool.internet`,
  `realtime.tool.memory` and `realtime.tool.codexCli`.
- `.env.local` generation now records `TECHSCOPE_REALTIME_TOOLS` for selected
  realtime tools.
- Schema and tests were extended to cover the realtime tool surface.
- Documentation and standards now state that voice control is not complete
  unless the selected tool surface is visible in readiness checks.', 'a80d650930e69f7dd44834636e335b701b88e272b35c584f026c075f009f5c94', 104
);
INSERT INTO chunks_fts (text, heading, document_id, chunk_id)
VALUES ('## Changes Made

- Added default realtime tools to `scripts/setup.mjs`: `internet`, `memory`,
  `codexCli`.
- Setup state now records `realtime.enabled`, `realtime.mode` and selected
  realtime tools.
- Setup sections now include `realtime.tool.internet`,
  `realtime.tool.memory` and `realtime.tool.codexCli`.
- `.env.local` generation now records `TECHSCOPE_REALTIME_TOOLS` for selected
  realtime tools.
- Schema and tests were extended to cover the realtime tool surface.
- Documentation and standards now state that voice control is not complete
  unless the selected tool surface is visible in readiness checks.', 'Changes Made', '2026-05-28-pritha-realtime-tool-defaults-setup-report', '2026-05-28-pritha-realtime-tool-defaults-setup-report#3');

INSERT INTO chunks (id, document_id, ordinal, heading, text, hash, token_count)
VALUES (
  '2026-05-28-pritha-realtime-tool-defaults-setup-report#4', '2026-05-28-pritha-realtime-tool-defaults-setup-report', 4, 'Marketing And Product Identity Update',
  '## Marketing And Product Identity Update

Pritha''s product self-description now includes the shorthand:

- Pritha is a harness for an agent that builds the harness of a new agent.
- The lineage model is genetic: Seed, inheritance, mutation, trial and
  Descendant.
- A Claude Code version is coming as a future adapter path; v0.1 remains
  Codex-native.', 'b22b7c0fee9abd1acde9257d3e8ce3427a3ad48d1f67d31cce3d89972a780d4c', 76
);
INSERT INTO chunks_fts (text, heading, document_id, chunk_id)
VALUES ('## Marketing And Product Identity Update

Pritha''s product self-description now includes the shorthand:

- Pritha is a harness for an agent that builds the harness of a new agent.
- The lineage model is genetic: Seed, inheritance, mutation, trial and
  Descendant.
- A Claude Code version is coming as a future adapter path; v0.1 remains
  Codex-native.', 'Marketing And Product Identity Update', '2026-05-28-pritha-realtime-tool-defaults-setup-report', '2026-05-28-pritha-realtime-tool-defaults-setup-report#4');

INSERT INTO chunks (id, document_id, ordinal, heading, text, hash, token_count)
VALUES (
  '2026-05-28-pritha-realtime-tool-defaults-setup-report#5', '2026-05-28-pritha-realtime-tool-defaults-setup-report', 5, 'Result',
  '## Result

Realtime voice setup is now explicit instead of implicit. If memory search or
Codex CLI is unavailable, setup exposes the missing piece instead of hiding it
behind a generic voice-enabled status.', '0bfe044545fa3861c5c6faad3b8028ef95d4c9ff7190298b046e32ace2fd68c1', 45
);
INSERT INTO chunks_fts (text, heading, document_id, chunk_id)
VALUES ('## Result

Realtime voice setup is now explicit instead of implicit. If memory search or
Codex CLI is unavailable, setup exposes the missing piece instead of hiding it
behind a generic voice-enabled status.', 'Result', '2026-05-28-pritha-realtime-tool-defaults-setup-report', '2026-05-28-pritha-realtime-tool-defaults-setup-report#5');

