  '2026-05-28-techscope-quality-phase-0-baseline-report#12', '2026-05-28-techscope-quality-phase-0-baseline-report', 12, 'Rollback instructions',
  '## Rollback instructions

After Phase 0 commit exists:

```sh
git revert HEAD
```

