INSERT INTO chunks (id, document_id, ordinal, heading, text, hash, token_count)
VALUES (
  '2026-05-28-techscope-quality-phase-13-github-ci-release-prep-report#3', '2026-05-28-techscope-quality-phase-13-github-ci-release-prep-report', 3, 'Changes made',
  '## Changes made

Created:

- `.github/workflows/quality-gate.yml`
- `.github/workflows/memory-validate.yml`
- `.github/workflows/setup-wizard-smoke.yml`
- `.github/dependabot.yml`
- `docs/release.md`
- `scripts/pre-push-audit.mjs`
- `05_decisions/2026-05-28-pritha-public-snapshot-scrub.md`

Updated:

- `scripts/env-doctor.mjs`
  - `mlx-whisper` remains critical on macOS.
  - `mlx-whisper` is a warning on Linux CI because it is a local macOS transcription helper.
- `package.json`
  - Added `pre-push-audit` script.
- Markdown memory snapshot
  - Replaced local absolute paths with placeholders.
  - Replaced Telegram numeric user/chat id with `telegram-user`.
  - Renamed tracked files that contained the Telegram id.
- `docs/release.md`
  - Documented branch protection, release flow, tag flow and safe publication handoff.', 'c6b7e6ff5c6f06e9ae55d14b3bae1e78fd8cbb921dc4dec39e1e4e10efb13b49', 123
);
INSERT INTO chunks_fts (text, heading, document_id, chunk_id)
VALUES ('## Changes made

Created:

- `.github/workflows/quality-gate.yml`
- `.github/workflows/memory-validate.yml`
- `.github/workflows/setup-wizard-smoke.yml`
- `.github/dependabot.yml`
- `docs/release.md`
- `scripts/pre-push-audit.mjs`
- `05_decisions/2026-05-28-pritha-public-snapshot-scrub.md`

Updated:

- `scripts/env-doctor.mjs`
  - `mlx-whisper` remains critical on macOS.
  - `mlx-whisper` is a warning on Linux CI because it is a local macOS transcription helper.
- `package.json`
  - Added `pre-push-audit` script.
- Markdown memory snapshot
  - Replaced local absolute paths with placeholders.
  - Replaced Telegram numeric user/chat id with `telegram-user`.
  - Renamed tracked files that contained the Telegram id.
- `docs/release.md`
  - Documented branch protection, release flow, tag flow and safe publication handoff.', 'Changes made', '2026-05-28-techscope-quality-phase-13-github-ci-release-prep-report', '2026-05-28-techscope-quality-phase-13-github-ci-release-prep-report#3');

INSERT INTO chunks (id, document_id, ordinal, heading, text, hash, token_count)
VALUES (
  '2026-05-28-techscope-quality-phase-13-github-ci-release-prep-report#4', '2026-05-28-techscope-quality-phase-13-github-ci-release-prep-report', 4, 'CI design',
  '## CI design

- `Quality Gate`
  - Runs on pull requests and pushes to `main`.
  - Matrix: Ubuntu latest, Node 20 and Node 22.
  - Installs portable Python dependencies and runs `env-doctor` + `quality-gate`.
- `Memory Validate`
  - Runs for memory/source-of-truth path changes.
  - Runs `validate-memory`, `rebuild-memory` and count sanity.
- `Setup Wizard Smoke`
  - Runs for setup workflow/script changes.
  - Runs the Phase 12 setup CLI in temp state/env paths.
- Dependabot
  - Weekly npm, pip and GitHub Actions update checks.', '202f41a7d6bed62c1d89d124217f5499208c685dd2f98193579295d3479f06e5', 111
);
INSERT INTO chunks_fts (text, heading, document_id, chunk_id)
VALUES ('## CI design

- `Quality Gate`
  - Runs on pull requests and pushes to `main`.
  - Matrix: Ubuntu latest, Node 20 and Node 22.
  - Installs portable Python dependencies and runs `env-doctor` + `quality-gate`.
- `Memory Validate`
  - Runs for memory/source-of-truth path changes.
  - Runs `validate-memory`, `rebuild-memory` and count sanity.
- `Setup Wizard Smoke`
  - Runs for setup workflow/script changes.
  - Runs the Phase 12 setup CLI in temp state/env paths.
- Dependabot
  - Weekly npm, pip and GitHub Actions update checks.', 'CI design', '2026-05-28-techscope-quality-phase-13-github-ci-release-prep-report', '2026-05-28-techscope-quality-phase-13-github-ci-release-prep-report#4');

INSERT INTO chunks (id, document_id, ordinal, heading, text, hash, token_count)
VALUES (
  '2026-05-28-techscope-quality-phase-13-github-ci-release-prep-report#5', '2026-05-28-techscope-quality-phase-13-github-ci-release-prep-report', 5, 'Verification results',
  '## Verification results

Phase-specific checks:

- Official GitHub action/dependabot/branch-protection sources checked on 2026-05-28.
- `git log --all -- .env .env.local ''*.sqlite'' ''*.token'' ''secrets/*'' --oneline` -> empty.
- `git ls-files | grep ''6208460904''` -> 0.
- `git grep -n ''6208460904''` -> no matches.
- `git grep -n ''<private local path pattern>''` -> no matches.
- `node scripts/pre-push-audit.mjs --json` -> pass:
  - secret history: pass;
  - forbidden tracked files: pass;
  - local absolute paths: pass;
  - Telegram id candidates: pass;
  - `gitleaks` and `trufflehog`: missing locally, documented as optional one-time scanners.
- `node scripts/validate-memory.mjs` -> pass after scrub/renames.
- `node scripts/quality-gate.mjs` -> pass.
- `npm test --silent` -> golden checks pass + 36 tests pass.
- `node scripts/golden-checks.mjs --with-embeddings` -> pass.

Final memory stats:

- documents: 420
- chunks: 4037
- entities: 1003
- relations: 10768
- embeddings: 3887', '7e2342e90e0102bdd3b1e5e82884af424de4898f5328c6a830a01fca5c064ec6', 185
);
