- Smoke test: pass.
- Interface status: pass.
- Memory status: pass.
- Tools status: pass.
- Operations status: pass.
- Deployment plan: not-applicable, expected until deployment automation phase.', '62c93e84372d32d1e3d466270452a95d205a5b215c170975aa4d5c0e9b3650c5', 189
);
