INSERT INTO chunks (id, document_id, ordinal, heading, text, hash, token_count)
VALUES (
  '2026-05-28-techscope-quality-phase-7-report#2', '2026-05-28-techscope-quality-phase-7-report', 2, 'Summary',
  '## Summary

Phase 7 completed successfully. Techscope now has one serialized quality gate
for Codex sessions, local pre-commit usage and future CI. The gate runs the
core health checks in order instead of encouraging parallel memory-writing
commands that can lock SQLite.

Created:

- `scripts/quality-gate.mjs`
- `scripts/audit-report.mjs`
- `08_templates/techscope-audit-phase-report.md`
- `.githooks/pre-commit`
- `.githooks/README.md`
- `tests/quality-gate.test.mjs`

Updated:

- `package.json`
  - Added `quality`: `node scripts/quality-gate.mjs`.
- `.gitignore`
  - Ignores `.memory/reports/` generated gate JSON snapshots.', '55ad5cd73b2707109bbaaab2b34df61afc7dd5361c650ef53c51b0e3e28f81e3', 96
);
INSERT INTO chunks_fts (text, heading, document_id, chunk_id)
VALUES ('## Summary

Phase 7 completed successfully. Techscope now has one serialized quality gate
for Codex sessions, local pre-commit usage and future CI. The gate runs the
core health checks in order instead of encouraging parallel memory-writing
commands that can lock SQLite.

Created:

- `scripts/quality-gate.mjs`
- `scripts/audit-report.mjs`
- `08_templates/techscope-audit-phase-report.md`
- `.githooks/pre-commit`
- `.githooks/README.md`
- `tests/quality-gate.test.mjs`

Updated:

- `package.json`
  - Added `quality`: `node scripts/quality-gate.mjs`.
- `.gitignore`
  - Ignores `.memory/reports/` generated gate JSON snapshots.', 'Summary', '2026-05-28-techscope-quality-phase-7-report', '2026-05-28-techscope-quality-phase-7-report#2');

