INSERT INTO chunks (id, document_id, ordinal, heading, text, hash, token_count)
VALUES (
  '2026-05-28-techscope-quality-phase-8-self-test-report#5', '2026-05-28-techscope-quality-phase-8-self-test-report', 5, 'Regressions observed',
  '## Regressions observed

During implementation, `self-test --dry-run` initially compared synthetic
`documents: 0` against the real previous baseline and failed after the first
real baseline was written. Fixed by skipping document-count regression checks in
dry-run mode. Dry-run now validates contracts only.', '599a5557b847f0fb4c50ec964cd60751cd1af488d1e826bb1a12ed8f94672ef4', 54
);
