  '2026-05-28-techscope-quality-phase-9c-agents-mother-scaffold-module-report#7', '2026-05-28-techscope-quality-phase-9c-agents-mother-scaffold-module-report', 7, 'AM-CANDIDATE patterns',
  '## AM-CANDIDATE patterns

- `snapshot-guarded-scaffold-extraction`: generator refactors must preserve a
  frozen scaffold file-list snapshot.
