VALUES (
  '2026-05-29-fespa26-agent-test-report#4', '2026-05-29-fespa26-agent-test-report', 4, 'Checks',
  '## Checks

| Check | Result | Notes |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Structure | pass | README.md or package.json should exist for a maintainable project. |
| Agent instructions | pass | Expected AGENTS.md, CLAUDE.md, GEMINI.md or another explicit agent instruction surface. |
| Interface manifest | pass | TechScope-generated agents should document selected interface adapters. |
| Memory manifest | pass | TechScope-generated agents should document memory profile and source of truth. |
| Tool manifest | pass | TechScope-generated agents should document tool boundaries. |
| Operations manifest | pass | TechScope-generated agents should document service mode, autostart policy, healthcheck and logs. |
| Env example | pass | .env.example should document required secrets without storing values. |
| Env secrets | pass | No .env file detected. |
| Smoke test | pass | FESPA26 smoke test passed. |
| Interface status | pass | Interfaces for FESPA26: - web: active (primary) - cli: active (maintenance) |
| Memory status | pass | Memory profile: sqlite-operational-memory Database: data/fespa26.sqlite3 Tables: 12 |
| Tools status | pass | Tools for FESPA26: - OpenAI Realtime API: active (server API) - Codex CLI: active (local sidecar) - FESPA memory API: active (local Next.js API) - Realtime tool router: active (server API) - FESPA job runner: active (local queue) |
| Operations status | pass | Deployment target: local Mac Service mode: manual Autostart: disabled Drop ingest: npm run ingest:drop Job runner: npm run jobs:run -- --until-idle --limit 1 --max-jobs 50 (automatic-triggered-sequential) Healthcheck: npm run smoke && npm run lint && npm test  |
| Deployment plan | pass | Plan: FESPA26 runs manually with ''npm run dev''. Autostart: disabled. No launchd install is selected. |
| Telegram dry-run | not-applicable | Telegram adapter not detected. |', '2f7dcadfc318e6db106fd9a5d2658c2cfab6d893a6dcd4aaa76f5ce7d3538027', 407
);
