Status: complete', 'Agent Operations Report: FESPA26 and Funny Teacher Tailscale Serve Recovery', '2026-06-01-fespa26-funny-teacher-tailscale-serve-recovery-report', '2026-06-01-fespa26-funny-teacher-tailscale-serve-recovery-report#1');

INSERT INTO chunks (id, document_id, ordinal, heading, text, hash, token_count)
VALUES (
  '2026-06-01-fespa26-funny-teacher-tailscale-serve-recovery-report#2', '2026-06-01-fespa26-funny-teacher-tailscale-serve-recovery-report', 2, 'Summary',
  '## Summary

FESPA26 and Funny Teacher were restored to a stable shared Tailscale Serve state on the mac mini.

The recovery sequence deliberately restored the known-good FESPA26 voice service first, then added Funny Teacher as a separate HTTPS mapping. This avoided mixing application debugging with Tailscale Serve debugging.', 'c9f847487d0bc5b3bcdf3557346be261190f79971f77d9f6d0462741839f1f1d', 65
);
INSERT INTO chunks_fts (text, heading, document_id, chunk_id)
VALUES ('## Summary

FESPA26 and Funny Teacher were restored to a stable shared Tailscale Serve state on the mac mini.

The recovery sequence deliberately restored the known-good FESPA26 voice service first, then added Funny Teacher as a separate HTTPS mapping. This avoided mixing application debugging with Tailscale Serve debugging.', 'Summary', '2026-06-01-fespa26-funny-teacher-tailscale-serve-recovery-report', '2026-06-01-fespa26-funny-teacher-tailscale-serve-recovery-report#2');

INSERT INTO chunks (id, document_id, ordinal, heading, text, hash, token_count)
VALUES (
  '2026-06-01-fespa26-funny-teacher-tailscale-serve-recovery-report#3', '2026-06-01-fespa26-funny-teacher-tailscale-serve-recovery-report', 3, 'Final State',
  '## Final State

| Service | Tailscale URL | Tailscale upstream | Local upstream | Status |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| FESPA26 voice | `https://ivans-mac-mini.tail691439.ts.net:3026/voice` | `3026` | `http://127.0.0.1:3027` | restored and user-verified |
| Funny Teacher | `https://ivans-mac-mini.tail691439.ts.net:3034/` | `3034` | `http://127.0.0.1:3033` | restored and user-verified |

Current `tailscale serve status` shape:

```text
https://ivans-mac-mini.tail691439.ts.net:3026 (tailnet only)
|-- / proxy http://127.0.0.1:3027

https://ivans-mac-mini.tail691439.ts.net:3034 (tailnet only)
|-- / proxy http://127.0.0.1:3033
```', 'c64160fc8687b2668b4ca944387095bdfe63ac4965c10323c58bef87c3100bde', 104
);
