  '### Workflow: agents-mother

- Path: 07_workflows/agents-mother.md
- Basis: Use TechScope as an agent factory: design, validate, scaffold, test and hand off new working agents from a user request or jointly developed specification. The default v1 target is a production-testable sibling project. The first implementation path is `codex-native + optional Telegram interface`.', 'b53fe6d8994877962acab3ae91a6b412f85a358e122e5dcf69434f730959505a', 69
);
