fragments for Pritha.', 'Purpose', 'pritha-myths-and-stories', 'pritha-myths-and-stories#2');

INSERT INTO chunks (id, document_id, ordinal, heading, text, hash, token_count)
VALUES (
  'pritha-myths-and-stories#3', 'pritha-myths-and-stories', 3, 'Guardrail',
  '## Guardrail

This file is a creative surface. It is allowed to be warm, mythic and memorable,
but it is not evidence of what Pritha can do. Any capability claim must be
backed by standards, decisions, workflows, tests or reports before it appears in
serious product documentation.', '1dc9bf71d4086a4a2101f021f5fe0c92e53f157005cf6c7bb9387172a485656c', 64
);
